WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:05.380
<b>Helck and company resume their journey
to get back to the Empire.</b>

00:05.380 --> 00:08.080
<b>After a deadly encounter
with the warrior of darkness,</b>

00:08.080 --> 00:10.130
<b>they manage to defeat him in battle.</b>

00:10.290 --> 00:13.380
<b>And thereby learn the details
of his tragic past.</b>

00:40.420 --> 00:42.670
<b>Kurui dashita haguruma ga</b>

00:42.670 --> 00:45.330
<b>Kanakirigoe de sakendeiru</b>

00:45.330 --> 00:47.330
<b>Hibana o chirasu unmei</b>

00:47.330 --> 00:50.170
<b>Moeagaru suki o ukagau mitai</b>

00:50.420 --> 00:52.500
<b>Yabai card hikiateta</b>

00:52.500 --> 00:55.130
<b>Pinch no toki koso chance da</b>

00:55.130 --> 00:57.040
<b>Mada akiramete nanka nai</b>

00:57.040 --> 00:59.920
<b>Saigo made tatsu mono ga shousha da</b>

01:00.130 --> 01:01.630
<b>Hohoemi kakeru akuma</b>

01:01.630 --> 01:05.080
<b>To te o toriatte odorou</b>

01:05.080 --> 01:07.330
<b>Narifuri kamau koto wa nai</b>

01:07.330 --> 01:09.670
<b>Gekijou ni yuragu ketsui</b>

01:09.670 --> 01:12.630
<b>Yami ni nomarete shimau mae ni</b>

01:12.830 --> 01:13.500
<b>Break it</b>

01:13.500 --> 01:15.000
<b>Keriagero</b>

01:15.000 --> 01:18.080
<b>Kudakechiru no wa kimi no joushiki da</b>

01:18.080 --> 01:22.580
<b>Dare ni mo makenai honoo kokoro ni daite</b>

01:22.880 --> 01:28.290
<b>Ima hateshinai sekai ni sasageru kono inori ga</b>

01:28.290 --> 01:33.040
<b>Kanau asu ga kuru made taeru koto naku</b>

01:33.040 --> 01:34.670
<b>Moyashi tsuzukeru</b>

01:34.670 --> 01:37.540
<b>It's my soul</b>

01:45.040 --> 01:49.960
<b>The Spirit of Faith</b>

02:05.330 --> 02:06.460
<b>There you are.</b>

02:06.460 --> 02:07.580
<b>You're mine.</b>

02:07.580 --> 02:09.540
<b>Just don't know when to give up, do you?</b>

02:12.000 --> 02:13.580
<b>I'm six for six right now.</b>

02:13.580 --> 02:15.500
<b>Are you ever going to get better at this?</b>

02:15.500 --> 02:16.420
<b>Shut up.</b>

02:16.420 --> 02:17.920
<b>I'm not losing to you this time.</b>

02:23.130 --> 02:26.580
<b>The humans launched
another offensive on Castle Urum,</b>

02:23.130 --> 02:29.040
<b>Castle Urum</b>

02:23.130 --> 02:29.040
<b>Castle Thor</b>

02:26.580 --> 02:29.080
<b>but our defense forces
were able to intercept and repel them.</b>

02:29.330 --> 02:33.670
<b>Soon after, the special assault team led by
Lord Azudra succeeded in retaking Castle Thor.</b>

02:33.790 --> 02:36.210
<b>And we immediately began
reinforcing the castle defenses</b>

02:36.210 --> 02:38.670
<b>to hold the line against
the invading human army.</b>

02:38.830 --> 02:39.790
<b>However...</b>

02:40.710 --> 02:42.670
<b>the heroes can resurrect endlessly.</b>

02:43.380 --> 02:47.540
<b>Castle Thor</b>

02:43.380 --> 02:47.540
<b>[Land of Humans]</b>

02:43.380 --> 02:47.540
<b>Border Fortress</b>

02:43.500 --> 02:45.710
<b>And without the risk of death,
the human army</b>

02:45.710 --> 02:47.580
<b>has just launched attack after attack.</b>

02:47.710 --> 02:49.830
<b>Fortunately, our defense forces include</b>

02:49.830 --> 02:52.960
<b>many fearless warriors who participated
in the New Demon Lord tournament,</b>

02:52.960 --> 02:56.080
<b>and they've been able to fend off
the humans thus far.</b>

03:01.040 --> 03:02.040
<b>Got you!</b>

03:02.040 --> 03:03.130
<b>Yeah, right!</b>

03:03.790 --> 03:05.920
<b>We still hold the upper hand for now.</b>

03:05.920 --> 03:07.040
<b>Dammit...</b>

03:07.710 --> 03:10.250
<b>But once they reach their full potential as heroes,</b>

03:10.250 --> 03:13.290
<b>it's going to become impossible
for us to deal with them.</b>

03:13.750 --> 03:18.710
<b>Just thinking about the future
is enough to fill me with worry and dread.</b>

03:18.960 --> 03:23.420
<b>But, that being said, I know
I can't afford to lose my courage now.</b>

03:23.420 --> 03:26.670
<b>Since times like these are when it's
most important to stand firm and have faith.</b>

03:26.670 --> 03:27.790
<b>Alrighty!</b>

03:27.790 --> 03:31.040
<b>Attention all!
Your meals have been prepared!</b>

03:31.040 --> 03:33.920
<b>Please come and eat in shifts
starting with those on break!</b>

03:33.920 --> 03:36.040
<b>Hell yeah! I've been waiting for this!</b>

03:36.540 --> 03:38.040
<b>Cool, I'm gonna go stuff my face.</b>

03:38.040 --> 03:40.040
<b>Hey, did ya see the
invisible attack I pulled off?</b>

03:40.040 --> 03:41.750
<b>Totally! Couldn't see a thing!</b>

03:41.750 --> 03:42.920
<b>I'll stay and keep fighting!</b>

03:42.920 --> 03:44.670
<b>Well, I'm pawsitively starving!</b>

03:44.830 --> 03:47.000
<b>Check it out! I've got a battle scar!</b>

03:47.000 --> 03:48.750
<b>Badass! Wear it like a medal!</b>

03:48.750 --> 03:51.170
<b>Please line up over here if you're injured!</b>

03:51.170 --> 03:52.710
<b>I'm in the battle scar club, too!</b>

03:52.710 --> 03:53.630
<b>Nice!</b>

03:55.420 --> 03:58.580
<b>I imagine that...
everyone is feeling uneasy deep down.</b>

03:59.290 --> 04:03.000
<b>Lord Azudra, we've successfully fended off
yet another one of their attacks.</b>

04:03.000 --> 04:04.670
<b>Yes. Excellent work.</b>

04:04.670 --> 04:08.500
<b>Except we only managed to apprehend
five of their winged knights.</b>

04:08.500 --> 04:12.710
<b>It seems they really have taken steps
to avoid letting themselves be captured alive.</b>

04:12.710 --> 04:14.500
<b>Considering the battles that are to come,</b>

04:14.500 --> 04:18.250
<b>I was hoping to use this opportunity to
weaken their forces as much as possible.</b>

04:18.250 --> 04:22.790
<b>But I guess our plan to take prisoners
isn't going to pay off any more than this.</b>

04:22.790 --> 04:24.000
<b>Indeed.</b>

04:24.000 --> 04:25.210
<b>Pardon me.</b>

04:25.210 --> 04:26.500
<b>Yes, please come in.</b>

04:26.500 --> 04:29.000
<b>We have the results, Lord Azudra.</b>

04:29.580 --> 04:33.710
<b>The rank-and-file soldiers of the human army
have now gone up to combat level 30.</b>

04:33.710 --> 04:37.500
<b>And their leader Edil
has gone up to combat level 36.</b>

04:38.000 --> 04:40.210
<b>This is the second time
that Edil has leveled up.</b>

04:41.960 --> 04:43.790
<b>They're progressing rather quickly.</b>

04:43.790 --> 04:45.830
<b>Just raising your combat level by one</b>

04:45.830 --> 04:48.420
<b>typically requires a fair amount
of intense training,</b>

04:48.420 --> 04:51.880
<b>but they've gone up a level
after only a handful of battles.</b>

04:51.880 --> 04:56.080
<b>I have to say, the attributes that come along
with hero status really are out of this world.</b>

04:56.580 --> 04:58.580
<b>We'll need to reinforce our army soon,</b>

04:58.580 --> 05:01.420
<b>otherwise we might start
taking heavy casualties.</b>

05:01.420 --> 05:04.170
<b>Yes, but we're already lacking
in soldiers on all fronts.</b>

05:05.130 --> 05:08.170
<b>We may need to push the timeline
of our plan up.</b>

05:08.170 --> 05:10.210
<b>Actually, I have one more thing to report.</b>

05:10.210 --> 05:13.290
<b>We also measured the combat level
of our own forces.</b>

05:13.290 --> 05:17.040
<b>First Platoon Leader, Hyura,
has reached combat level 52.</b>

05:17.250 --> 05:21.290
<b>First Platoon Soldier, Rebero,
has reached combat level 44.</b>

05:21.500 --> 05:25.080
<b>Third Platoon Soldier, Lelepus,
has reached combat level 46.</b>

05:25.080 --> 05:26.580
<b>They're all higher than before.</b>

05:26.960 --> 05:28.790
<b>Well now! That's reassuring to hear!</b>

05:28.790 --> 05:29.920
<b>How wonderful!</b>

05:29.920 --> 05:32.290
<b>I'd expect nothing less
from those aiming to be Demon Lord!</b>

05:32.420 --> 05:35.330
<b>Our people are proving they have what it takes
to keep pace with the heroes!</b>

05:35.330 --> 05:37.250
<b>That means we'll be able
to hold out for awhile longer.</b>

05:37.250 --> 05:38.920
<b>Things are looking up!</b>

05:40.580 --> 05:41.790
<b>What's the matter?</b>

05:41.790 --> 05:42.960
<b>Nothing...</b>

05:43.420 --> 05:44.880
<b>Is it just my imagination?</b>

05:45.710 --> 05:49.920
<b>Thanks for your report.
Welp, guess it's time for the daily ritual!</b>

05:49.920 --> 05:52.380
<b>You really should take a break, sir!</b>

05:52.380 --> 05:53.880
<b>Pardon me!</b>

05:53.880 --> 05:55.420
<b>Yes, please come in.</b>

05:55.420 --> 05:57.830
<b>Your tea is ready, Lord Azudra!</b>

05:57.830 --> 05:59.040
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:59.040 --> 06:00.920
<b>Please set it down over there.</b>

06:00.920 --> 06:02.000
<b>Lord Azudra,</b>

06:02.000 --> 06:05.880
<b>are you sure you're not running yourself
ragged from using your magic every day?</b>

06:05.880 --> 06:07.500
<b>Would you like me
to give you a shoulder rub?</b>

06:07.500 --> 06:08.750
<b>No, that's okay.</b>

06:08.750 --> 06:12.080
<b>I'm perfectly fine. In tip-top shape.</b>

06:12.080 --> 06:13.420
<b>That's a big fat lie.</b>

06:13.420 --> 06:15.540
<b>Lord Azudra's basically ready to fall over.</b>

06:15.540 --> 06:16.630
<b>You shut your mouth!</b>

06:16.630 --> 06:19.380
<b>Please don't push yourself too hard, okay?</b>

06:19.380 --> 06:22.710
<b>The morale of the troops would plummet
if anything were to happen to you.</b>

06:22.710 --> 06:24.290
<b>Yes, I'm aware.</b>

06:24.290 --> 06:25.420
<b>If I don't have any luck today,</b>

06:25.420 --> 06:28.710
<b>then I'll start using the locator spell
every other day instead.</b>

06:28.710 --> 06:30.000
<b>Another big fat lie.</b>

06:30.000 --> 06:33.000
<b>You said that once before and yet here you are,
still doing it on a daily basis.</b>

06:33.000 --> 06:34.460
<b>You shut your mouth!</b>

06:34.460 --> 06:36.750
<b>I guess you can't help but be worried...</b>

06:37.290 --> 06:39.540
<b>The locator spell uses
a wooden doll as a proxy</b>

06:39.540 --> 06:42.670
<b>to show the current whereabouts
of the given person.</b>

06:42.670 --> 06:44.630
<b>Even if the doll lands
somewhere outside of the map,</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:46.380
<b>as long as it continues to move,</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:49.630
<b>it serves as proof that
Lady Vermilio is still alive.</b>

06:49.630 --> 06:54.170
<b>I'm sure Lord Azudra is doing this mainly
to confirm that and give himself peace of mind.</b>

06:54.170 --> 06:56.210
<b>Okay, my wooden doll.</b>

06:56.210 --> 06:58.790
<b>Show me where Vermikins is right now!</b>

07:02.750 --> 07:03.790
<b>Oh! It moved!</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:07.710
<b>This is your first time seeing
the locator spell in action, yes?</b>

07:07.710 --> 07:11.130
<b>It always moves around like this,
but then ends up stopping off the map.</b>

07:13.830 --> 07:16.380
<b>The wooden doll is pointing
to a location on the map!</b>

07:16.790 --> 07:17.830
<b>She's on the move!</b>

07:17.830 --> 07:19.790
<b>Vermikins is making progress!</b>

07:19.790 --> 07:21.960
<b>What great news, Lord Azudra!</b>

07:21.960 --> 07:23.420
<b>Congratulations!</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:24.290
<b>Thank you!</b>

07:24.960 --> 07:27.130
<b>So, you crossed the ocean?</b>

07:27.130 --> 07:28.380
<b>Fantastic.</b>

07:28.380 --> 07:30.710
<b>You never fail to impress, Vermikins!</b>

07:31.130 --> 07:33.210
<b>Okay! There's no time to be sitting around!</b>

07:33.210 --> 07:35.540
<b>We should have a detailed map
of the southern region somewhere!</b>

07:35.540 --> 07:37.330
<b>Hon! Fetch it for me!</b>

07:37.330 --> 07:38.380
<b>As you wish.</b>

07:38.960 --> 07:39.960
<b>Goddammit!</b>

07:39.960 --> 07:42.460
<b>Those bastards are making
a laughingstock of us!</b>

07:42.630 --> 07:46.380
<b>That dog-faced asshole!
He used some weird weapon to bite at me!</b>

07:46.380 --> 07:48.630
<b>He's dead friggin' meat the next time I see him!</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:51.380
<b>Don't raise your voice. It's obnoxious.</b>

07:51.380 --> 07:54.000
<b>I dunno why you're always playing it cool!</b>

07:54.000 --> 07:57.330
<b>Seeing as how you keep getting
your ass handed to you by that freaky bitch!</b>

07:57.790 --> 08:01.130
<b>She's a strong opponent.
Defeating her isn't such an easy task.</b>

08:01.130 --> 08:02.710
<b>Hah! That's a laugh.</b>

08:02.710 --> 08:05.250
<b>Because it sounds like
you're prepared to lose every time.</b>

08:05.250 --> 08:09.040
<b>I bet the only reason you keep going
after that woman is to be a skirt-chaser!</b>

08:09.040 --> 08:10.920
<b>You better watch your mouth.</b>

08:10.920 --> 08:12.540
<b>Unless you wanna die.</b>

08:12.750 --> 08:13.880
<b>Go right ahead!</b>

08:13.880 --> 08:15.130
<b>Just try and kill me!</b>

08:15.130 --> 08:16.710
<b>We're immortal!</b>

08:16.710 --> 08:18.500
<b>Enough of your pathetic squabbling!</b>

08:19.130 --> 08:20.710
<b>The demonkin are powerful.</b>

08:20.710 --> 08:22.880
<b>So it's only natural for us
to lose at this point.</b>

08:22.880 --> 08:27.130
<b>Besides, you know that our current goal
has nothing to do with actually winning.</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:31.920
<b>There they go, bickering with each other again.</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:34.290
<b>Hard to believe they're on the same side.</b>

08:34.290 --> 08:37.290
<b>Anyways, what they just said
really piqued my interest.</b>

08:37.290 --> 08:39.580
<b>Winning isn't their goal, huh?</b>

08:40.040 --> 08:43.920
<b>I guess that means raising their combat level
is their main focus for right now.</b>

08:43.920 --> 08:46.920
<b>Or is there something else
they're trying to accomplish?</b>

08:47.080 --> 08:48.830
<b>Can we end this meeting already?</b>

08:48.830 --> 08:50.330
<b>I'm taking my leave.</b>

08:50.330 --> 08:52.210
<b>Yeah, I'm getting out of here, too.</b>

08:52.210 --> 08:53.380
<b>Fine then.</b>

08:53.380 --> 08:55.210
<b>The meeting is adjourned for today.</b>

08:55.750 --> 08:57.920
<b>Aw man, they're done already?</b>

08:57.920 --> 09:00.580
<b>I hardly gleaned any new info from that.</b>

09:01.880 --> 09:04.040
<b>Who the hell is up there?!</b>

09:11.380 --> 09:13.000
<b>I don't sense them anymore.</b>

09:13.830 --> 09:15.080
<b>Was it an intruder?</b>

09:15.080 --> 09:16.080
<b>I don't know.</b>

09:16.080 --> 09:17.580
<b>It could've just been my imagination.</b>

09:19.080 --> 09:20.460
<b>Close call!</b>

09:21.080 --> 09:23.750
<b>Okay. Let's increase the number of guards.</b>

09:23.750 --> 09:26.500
<b>A no-good rat might have snuck in here.</b>

09:26.500 --> 09:27.920
<b>That was pretty telling.</b>

09:27.920 --> 09:31.080
<b>Now I know for sure their hero abilities
are becoming sharper.</b>

09:31.080 --> 09:33.710
<b>This means I'm going to have to be
extra careful moving forward.</b>

09:39.540 --> 09:40.750
<b>Lord Azudra.</b>

09:40.750 --> 09:43.500
<b>I've assembled the
three-man search party you asked for.</b>

09:43.500 --> 09:45.210
<b>They can depart at anytime.</b>

09:45.210 --> 09:46.460
<b>Very good.</b>

09:46.460 --> 09:50.040
<b>But if I may, are you sure you
don't want to send a few more with them?</b>

09:50.040 --> 09:52.460
<b>No, that's plenty for right now.</b>

09:52.630 --> 09:55.830
<b>Because in the event that Vermikins
drastically changes course,</b>

09:55.830 --> 09:59.380
<b>we might end up needing
to mobilize another search party.</b>

09:59.380 --> 10:00.710
<b>Understood.</b>

10:00.710 --> 10:03.750
<b>Fortunately, things have been looking
in our favor these past few days.</b>

10:03.750 --> 10:07.040
<b>Vermikins has been consistently
moving right towards us,</b>

10:07.040 --> 10:10.750
<b>which indicates that she knows
what direction the Empire is in.</b>

10:10.960 --> 10:12.210
<b>If she stays on this course,</b>

10:12.210 --> 10:16.250
<b>then our search party might come across her
somewhere near this prairie.</b>

10:16.580 --> 10:18.880
<b>I hope things go that smoothly.</b>

10:19.790 --> 10:21.540
<b>Do you think Helck is still with her?</b>

10:23.130 --> 10:27.330
<b>I just can't imagine things will end well for us
if Helck turns out to be an enemy.</b>

10:27.750 --> 10:30.250
<b>In fact, the Empire might even...</b>

10:30.250 --> 10:33.750
<b>The future of the Empire will be
far more bleak if that happens.</b>

10:34.000 --> 10:36.630
<b>I mean, Helck is a menace
of the highest caliber,</b>

10:36.630 --> 10:38.710
<b>even among all the beings that I've met.</b>

10:39.130 --> 10:41.920
<b>However, I don't think we need to worry much.</b>

10:42.460 --> 10:46.790
<b>Vermikins must have observed Helck very closely
in the time since they passed through the gate.</b>

10:47.080 --> 10:52.290
<b>And if she has made the choice to
continue traveling alongside him even now,</b>

10:52.290 --> 10:55.790
<b>it must be because she determined
that Helck isn't an enemy.</b>

10:56.040 --> 10:59.170
<b>So basically, she's either
bringing Helck along as a powerful ally,</b>

10:59.170 --> 11:02.460
<b>or not at all so that we
don't have to worry about him.</b>

11:02.580 --> 11:03.630
<b>Yes.</b>

11:03.630 --> 11:06.460
<b>And I have no qualms
about trusting her judgement.</b>

11:06.460 --> 11:08.670
<b>Well then, I hope he comes back with her!</b>

11:08.670 --> 11:11.670
<b>Because there's no greater ally
we could hope for than Mr. Helck!</b>

11:11.670 --> 11:12.750
<b>That's a good point.</b>

11:12.750 --> 11:14.710
<b>Since they've constantly been
in each other's presence,</b>

11:14.710 --> 11:16.750
<b>it would be very difficult</b>

11:16.750 --> 11:20.380
<b>for even Helck the Hero to pull the wool
over someone as paranoid as Lady Vermilio...</b>

11:20.380 --> 11:21.750
<b>Wait a second!</b>

11:21.750 --> 11:23.250
<b>Constantly together?!</b>

11:23.920 --> 11:25.500
<b>Quit pretending, Lord Azudra.</b>

11:26.000 --> 11:28.380
<b>I think we all know you
were convinced that Helck</b>

11:28.380 --> 11:31.250
<b>was on our side from
the very first time you met him.</b>

11:31.250 --> 11:33.380
<b>Together both night and day...</b>

11:35.210 --> 11:36.330
<b>Don't be silly.</b>

11:36.330 --> 11:38.000
<b>It's like I told you before,</b>

11:38.000 --> 11:40.630
<b>Helck's immense power
is a threat to the Empire.</b>

11:40.630 --> 11:44.920
<b>Even someone like me isn't fearless enough
to just blindly trust him after one meeting.</b>

11:45.080 --> 11:49.250
<b>Trust is a two-way street that's built
gradually over time, after all.</b>

11:49.250 --> 11:50.380
<b>Right...</b>

11:50.380 --> 11:53.580
<b>That said, I felt a strong urge
to have faith in him.</b>

11:55.670 --> 11:57.250
<b>I mean, isn't it depressing?</b>

11:57.250 --> 11:59.710
<b>Maintaining this relationship
of nothing but bloodshed,</b>

11:59.710 --> 12:02.290
<b>despite the fact we can talk things out...</b>

12:04.250 --> 12:07.170
<b>Some of us have good hearts
and others do not.</b>

12:07.170 --> 12:09.290
<b>Humans are just the same in that respect.</b>

12:09.290 --> 12:12.920
<b>There are those among them who are genuinely
trying to sit at the bargaining table with us.</b>

12:15.630 --> 12:17.750
<b>If things hadn't taken such an awful turn,</b>

12:17.750 --> 12:21.000
<b>I think we could have found a way
to live in harmony with humans once again.</b>

12:21.830 --> 12:24.250
<b>I'm sorry... my old friend.</b>

12:34.630 --> 12:35.630
<b>Piwi!</b>

12:35.630 --> 12:37.210
<b>There were even more
of these monsters around?!</b>

12:37.210 --> 12:38.290
<b>I've got this!</b>

12:38.290 --> 12:39.460
<b>H-hold your horses!</b>

12:39.710 --> 12:41.540
<b>I want you to stay put!</b>

12:41.540 --> 12:43.170
<b>I'm going to handle this myself!</b>

12:51.830 --> 12:53.710
<b>That was awesome, Annie!</b>

12:53.960 --> 12:54.830
<b>Well done!</b>

12:55.710 --> 12:57.580
<b>That was awesome, Annie!</b>

12:57.580 --> 13:00.170
<b>Oh, yeah. Thank you.</b>

13:06.130 --> 13:07.380
<b>To be honest,</b>

13:07.710 --> 13:11.460
<b>ever since that time Helck lost control,
I've been afraid to let him fight.</b>

13:12.380 --> 13:14.920
<b>Helck's desire to oppose
the humans is genuine.</b>

13:15.500 --> 13:18.880
<b>He is not our enemy.
That's what I determined.</b>

13:19.330 --> 13:20.380
<b>But...</b>

13:20.670 --> 13:23.250
<b>after seeing him wield that awful power
with my own eyes,</b>

13:23.460 --> 13:27.380
<b>I've been unable to stop myself
from feeling uneasy about him once again.</b>

13:29.630 --> 13:32.750
<b>And after relying on his strength to
get us out of trouble so many times...</b>

13:33.250 --> 13:35.000
<b>It's so damn rude of me.</b>

13:35.750 --> 13:36.670
<b>Anne.</b>

13:37.750 --> 13:39.540
<b>The sun should be coming up soon.</b>

13:39.920 --> 13:43.540
<b>Let's call it quits for now
and find a good place to camp.</b>

13:44.040 --> 13:46.210
<b>Right. Good idea.</b>

13:47.290 --> 13:49.500
<b>The area by this rock should work.</b>

13:49.500 --> 13:50.330
<b>Alrighty!</b>

13:50.330 --> 13:52.330
<b>Guess I'll cook us up something tasty.</b>

13:52.330 --> 13:53.500
<b>I'm gonna sleep!</b>

13:54.460 --> 13:56.460
<b>You worked awfully hard today!</b>

13:56.460 --> 13:58.630
<b>Yeah! I did a bunch of needless running!</b>

14:02.460 --> 14:03.420
<b>Anne...</b>

14:04.250 --> 14:06.040
<b>Huh? What is it?</b>

14:06.250 --> 14:09.630
<b>If you don't mind,
could I have some of your time later?</b>

14:10.920 --> 14:13.420
<b>There's something
I would like to talk to you about.</b>

14:15.960 --> 14:17.580
<b>Okay! It's ready.</b>

14:18.830 --> 14:19.880
<b>Delish!</b>

14:20.880 --> 14:23.540
<b>You're even a master at making
a cup of hot chocolate, huh?</b>

14:23.540 --> 14:26.750
<b>All I did was add some of the cocoa powder
that we bought in town.</b>

14:27.000 --> 14:29.630
<b>So, what is it that you wanted to talk about?</b>

14:29.830 --> 14:30.790
<b>Well...</b>

14:33.290 --> 14:34.500
<b>Your short sword?</b>

14:35.670 --> 14:37.750
<b>There's actually more to it than meets the eye.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:40.000
<b>It used to be a longsword.</b>

14:40.920 --> 14:43.250
<b>A blade that was known as the "Hero Killer."</b>

14:43.250 --> 14:46.080
<b>This is what was leftover after it was broken.</b>

14:46.670 --> 14:48.290
<b>"Hero Killer"?!</b>

14:49.330 --> 14:50.710
<b>Like the name implies,</b>

14:50.710 --> 14:55.080
<b>this is a weapon that can deal
a devasting amount of damage to a hero.</b>

14:55.500 --> 14:58.460
<b>A lot of the magic that
dwelled within it has been lost.</b>

14:58.460 --> 15:03.130
<b>But in spite of that, it should still have
enough power left to end the life of a hero.</b>

15:03.830 --> 15:05.830
<b>And I would like you to hold onto it.</b>

15:07.130 --> 15:08.040
<b>I don't believe this.</b>

15:08.040 --> 15:11.580
<b>Did he pick up on the concerns
that I was having?</b>

15:12.170 --> 15:14.960
<b>When push comes to shove,
you can use this to take me out...</b>

15:14.960 --> 15:16.630
<b>W-wait a second, Helck!</b>

15:16.630 --> 15:18.170
<b>I need to come clean with you!</b>

15:18.170 --> 15:21.790
<b>To be blunt, I had doubts about you
in the beginning.</b>

15:21.790 --> 15:23.920
<b>I was convinced you were a spy
that the humans sent!</b>

15:23.920 --> 15:24.750
<b>Huh?</b>

15:24.750 --> 15:28.210
<b>Or, at the very least, you had come
to wage war on us by yourself.</b>

15:28.210 --> 15:29.380
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

15:29.500 --> 15:31.250
<b>But I don't feel that way anymore!</b>

15:31.250 --> 15:33.500
<b>I firmly believe you're not against us!</b>

15:33.500 --> 15:36.460
<b>I've gotten to know more
about you and your personality</b>

15:36.460 --> 15:38.420
<b>as we've made this journey together,</b>

15:38.420 --> 15:40.420
<b>and that's the conclusion I came to.</b>

15:40.420 --> 15:43.130
<b>Not to mention I'm very grateful
that you carry our luggage,</b>

15:43.130 --> 15:44.630
<b>do the cooking, and so much more!</b>

15:44.880 --> 15:47.290
<b>S-so don't give me a nasty weapon like that!</b>

15:47.290 --> 15:49.000
<b>I don't want it! Fool!</b>

15:52.630 --> 15:53.830
<b>That explains a lot!</b>

15:53.830 --> 15:56.880
<b>It felt like someone was staring holes
through me from time to time!</b>

15:56.880 --> 15:58.500
<b>S-sorry about that...</b>

15:58.500 --> 16:01.540
<b>But listen, it's water under the bridge now.</b>

16:01.920 --> 16:04.960
<b>Don't give me that sword. It's dangerous.</b>

16:06.000 --> 16:07.210
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:07.670 --> 16:10.920
<b>But even so, this is something
that I want you to do for me, Anne.</b>

16:10.920 --> 16:12.170
<b>What do you mean?</b>

16:12.170 --> 16:16.250
<b>Listen, I'm going to tell you about my past,
the power of heroes,</b>

16:16.250 --> 16:20.330
<b>and everything else that happened
in the human realm.</b>

16:21.210 --> 16:25.380
<b>Then once you've heard the story,
I'd like you to consider doing me this favor.</b>

16:30.750 --> 16:33.540
<b>Yakusoku suru yo</b>

16:33.540 --> 16:36.500
<b>Itsuka sekai ga</b>

16:36.500 --> 16:38.580
<b>Owaru toki mata</b>

16:38.580 --> 16:41.210
<b>Deaemasu you ni</b>

16:53.290 --> 16:58.670
<b>Hana no you na hito datta to</b>

16:58.670 --> 17:04.580
<b>Dareka ga chiisaku tsubuyaiteita</b>

17:04.580 --> 17:10.130
<b>Mizu no nai heya soredemo tashika ni</b>

17:10.130 --> 17:12.630
<b>Asu e saiteita</b>

17:14.330 --> 17:17.130
<b>Zenbu yume dattara</b>

17:17.130 --> 17:20.000
<b>Kimi o shiru koto mo</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:22.920
<b>Koi o suru koto mo</b>

17:22.920 --> 17:26.420
<b>Ikiru imi sae shirazu ni</b>

17:27.250 --> 17:30.040
<b>Tatoeba asu ga</b>

17:30.040 --> 17:32.750
<b>Donna ame demo</b>

17:32.750 --> 17:35.130
<b>Yoru wa ake sekai ni</b>

17:35.130 --> 17:38.210
<b>Niji ga kakaru you ni</b>

17:38.580 --> 17:41.290
<b>Mune no itami mo</b>

17:41.290 --> 17:44.210
<b>Tsutau namida mo</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:47.630
<b>Mirai e no tane ni kaete</b>

17:47.630 --> 17:49.250
<b>Ikiyou</b>

17:49.960 --> 17:52.000
<b>Bukiyou na ai ga</b>

17:52.000 --> 17:55.170
<b>Hana o sakasu made</b>

17:57.580 --> 18:01.420
<b>Piwi's Glorious Travel Journal</b>

17:58.330 --> 17:59.790
<b>There is a desert of green sand</b>

17:59.790 --> 18:01.460
<b>that stretches as far as the eye can see.</b>

18:01.830 --> 18:03.460
<b>At its entrance lies Palooze,</b>

18:03.460 --> 18:07.080
<b>a desert city known as a commercial hub
that many peddlers pass through.</b>

18:07.710 --> 18:08.670
<b>Knick-knacks,</b>

18:08.670 --> 18:09.500
<b>foods,</b>

18:09.500 --> 18:10.710
<b>garments,</b>

18:10.710 --> 18:12.210
<b>and scenic beauty.</b>

18:13.330 --> 18:16.420
<b>What sort of wonderful memories
are waiting for you</b>

18:16.420 --> 18:18.830
<b>in this city full of charm and character?</b>

18:18.830 --> 18:21.580
<b>That guy just keeps jabbering on and on...</b>

18:21.830 --> 18:23.540
<b>Who the hell even is he?</b>

18:23.540 --> 18:24.710
<b>Annie!</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:26.040
<b>What is it?</b>

18:27.330 --> 18:30.920
<b>I wanna bring back lots of cool stories
to tell everybody on the island!</b>

18:30.920 --> 18:35.920
<b>So I'm gonna use the travel journal I just got
from that weirdo to write them all down.</b>

18:36.080 --> 18:39.080
<b>Being in a new city is super exciting, huh!</b>

18:39.080 --> 18:40.130
<b>It sure is.</b>

18:40.630 --> 18:43.630
<b>We visited first avenue,
the main thoroughfare of Palooze!</b>

18:43.630 --> 18:45.420
<b>And there were a ton of shops!</b>

18:45.670 --> 18:49.040
<b>Ice cream! Ice cream!
Get your ice cream here, folks!</b>

18:49.420 --> 18:51.710
<b>Just look at how many peddlers there are.</b>

18:51.710 --> 18:53.750
<b>I hope there's a good selection
of hotels here.</b>

18:54.000 --> 18:56.750
<b>Hey there, travelers!
Care for some ice cream?</b>

18:56.750 --> 18:58.210
<b>No. We're not interested.</b>

18:58.210 --> 19:00.580
<b>Okay. Let's find a place to stay the night.</b>

19:00.580 --> 19:02.540
<b>Whoa, don't be hasty, miss.</b>

19:02.540 --> 19:05.580
<b>This ice cream is good stuff!
Like, top of the line!</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:07.040
<b>I said, we're not interested.</b>

19:07.040 --> 19:09.580
<b>It's just a little ice cream.
What could it hurt?</b>

19:09.580 --> 19:11.500
<b>Come now. Take a gander at the menu.</b>

19:11.500 --> 19:14.500
<b>Learn to take no for an answer, jeez!
We're not buying your ice cream!</b>

19:14.500 --> 19:15.830
<b>Besides, what's the deal with your menu?!</b>

19:15.830 --> 19:20.250
<b>Green Desert Special Milk Ice Cream</b>

19:15.830 --> 19:20.250
<b>Green Desert Special Strawberry Ice Cream</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:17.710
<b>Don't disrespect grape flavor like that!</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:20.250
<b>Regular Old Grape Ice Cream</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:20.250
<b>10 Lin each</b>

19:17.710 --> 19:20.290
<b>Come on now. Just have some ice cream.</b>

19:20.290 --> 19:21.210
<b>I promise it's tasty!</b>

19:21.210 --> 19:22.580
<b>Shaddup! I said no!</b>

19:22.580 --> 19:23.920
<b>Come on now.</b>

19:23.920 --> 19:24.960
<b>NO, DAMMIT!</b>

19:27.250 --> 19:28.250
<b>It's good!</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.960
<b>Green Desert Special</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.960
<b>Strawberry Ice Cream</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.960
<b>Regular Old Grape Ice Cream</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.960
<b>Green Desert Special</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.960
<b>Chocolate Ice Cream</b>

19:29.130 --> 19:30.170
<b>Yummy!</b>

19:30.920 --> 19:32.580
<b>The ice cream that the stubborn guy</b>

19:32.580 --> 19:34.000
<b>was selling was super tasty!</b>

19:34.000 --> 19:35.880
<b>Welcome to Palooze Plaza!</b>

19:35.880 --> 19:37.000
<b>According to legend,</b>

19:37.000 --> 19:41.380
<b>this the place where the avian creature
known as Yustem met its end in ages long past!</b>

19:41.580 --> 19:43.500
<b>It's always been the town square,</b>

19:43.500 --> 19:46.250
<b>since people were too afraid
to build any houses on top of it!</b>

19:46.920 --> 19:50.380
<b>You don't say?
Thanks for sharing that with me.</b>

19:51.960 --> 19:53.080
<b>Annie!</b>

19:53.080 --> 19:54.540
<b>Was he a friend of yours?</b>

19:54.540 --> 19:55.960
<b>Nope. Total stranger.</b>

19:55.960 --> 19:59.790
<b>There was a friendly local who told us
the history of the town square!</b>

20:00.290 --> 20:01.830
<b>Palooze Plaza!</b>

20:02.630 --> 20:06.040
<b>So many different things were being sold
at the shops there!</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.710
<b>Don't let any of these salespeople smooth talk
you into buying weird stuff that we don't need.</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
<b>Green Desert Fox Ears</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
<b>Green Desert Cat Ears</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
<b>Green Desert Rabbit Ears</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
<b>Dog</b>

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
<b>200 Lin each</b>

20:12.000 --> 20:13.130
<b>Annie!</b>

20:13.130 --> 20:14.210
<b>What is it?</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:16.500
<b>We found the Cameloinks!</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:21.630
<b>Cameloinks Ranch</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:21.630
<b>Your Personal Desert Guides</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:21.630
<b>Cameloinks For Sale</b>

20:17.670 --> 20:19.960
<b>Nomads, peddlers, you name it.</b>

20:19.960 --> 20:21.670
<b>Everybody uses these Cameloinks to travel.</b>

20:21.670 --> 20:25.290
<b>I'd recommend that you buy one of them
if you plan to pass through the desert.</b>

20:27.380 --> 20:28.880
<b>So stinky!</b>

20:29.080 --> 20:31.080
<b>The Cameloinks smelled really bad!</b>

20:31.080 --> 20:33.040
<b>Annie! They stink, huh?</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:36.290
<b>Not only will the Cameloinks
carry your luggage,</b>

20:36.290 --> 20:38.880
<b>but their poop makes for good fuel
because it burns easy.</b>

20:38.880 --> 20:41.880
<b>And worse case?
You can even eat them as emergency food.</b>

20:42.130 --> 20:43.540
<b>How convenient.</b>

20:43.540 --> 20:45.380
<b>This is the first legitimately useful thing</b>

20:45.380 --> 20:47.540
<b>that I've actually been tempted
to buy in this city.</b>

20:47.710 --> 20:49.250
<b>But man, they're expensive!</b>

20:49.250 --> 20:51.540
<b>The most that we can afford is 4,000 lin.</b>

20:51.920 --> 20:53.460
<b>Well, for 4,000...</b>

20:53.460 --> 20:55.210
<b>that little fella is all you can buy.</b>

20:55.540 --> 20:56.710
<b>Doggy!</b>

20:56.710 --> 20:59.540
<b>Even at their cheapest,
Cameloinks go for 10,000 lin.</b>

20:59.540 --> 21:01.130
<b>But you can have the dog for 200.</b>

21:01.130 --> 21:02.670
<b>Make sure you take
good care of him, alright?</b>

21:02.670 --> 21:04.040
<b>We don't need your dog.</b>

21:04.040 --> 21:07.580
<b>We only had 8,000 lin!
So we gave up on the Cameloinks!</b>

21:07.580 --> 21:09.750
<b>We've spent too much time
getting sidetracked.</b>

21:09.750 --> 21:11.380
<b>Let's hurry and find an inn.</b>

21:11.830 --> 21:13.250
<b>Annie!</b>

21:13.710 --> 21:15.170
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

21:16.670 --> 21:17.710
<b>Dancing!</b>

21:18.000 --> 21:20.540
<b>Uh-huh. Well, it's time to go look for an inn.</b>

21:20.960 --> 21:23.130
<b>Don't be shy, come and join in the fun!</b>

21:23.130 --> 21:25.250
<b>Cut it out! I'm not going to dance!</b>

21:38.080 --> 21:38.960
<b>One, two...</b>

21:38.960 --> 21:39.670
<b>Pose!</b>

21:40.330 --> 21:43.540
<b>What the flying hell...
am I even doing right now?</b>

21:44.330 --> 21:46.080
<b>Such incredible dancing.</b>

21:47.750 --> 21:49.920
<b>You're travelers from out of town, right?</b>

21:49.920 --> 21:52.880
<b>Why don't you come and stay
at my hotel, darlings.</b>

21:52.880 --> 21:54.630
<b>I'll hook you up with a discount.</b>

21:57.500 --> 21:58.540
<b>Uh, I think...</b>

21:58.790 --> 22:00.000
<b>this place must be expensive.</b>

22:01.250 --> 22:04.500
<b>Tonight we're staying at the best
and fanciest place in town!</b>

22:04.500 --> 22:07.210
<b>Luxury Hotel</b>

22:05.540 --> 22:07.250
<b>That's way too much of a discount!</b>

22:07.580 --> 22:09.710
<b>It was another day full of smiles from Helck!</b>

22:09.880 --> 22:12.670
<b>And Annie throwing her fits!
She must enjoy it!</b>

22:13.130 --> 22:14.670
<b>I had so much fun!</b>

22:14.670 --> 22:18.380
<b>We're going to travel through
the green desert tomorrow,</b>

22:18.380 --> 22:22.330
<b>but I'm worried those two might
lose sight of me along the way.</b>

22:22.330 --> 22:25.420
<b>Because I'm the same color as all the sand!</b>

22:25.920 --> 22:27.500
<b>Time for bed, Piwi.</b>

22:27.500 --> 22:28.790
<b>'Kay!</b>

22:33.210 --> 22:34.630
<b>Good night!</b>

22:34.960 --> 22:38.130
<b>I hope our journey through the desert
is just as fun!</b>

22:38.130 --> 22:41.830
<b>Seriously, why do you always
have to sleep right next to my face?</b>

22:42.210 --> 22:43.130
<b>Cheep!</b>

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>With Younger Brother in Tow</b>

22:46.710 --> 22:49.750
<b>Next time: "With Younger Brother in Tow"</b>
